---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
// Cuando tengas capturas reales:
// import project1Img from '../../assets/images/projects/portfolio.png';
// import project2Img from '../../assets/images/projects/tfg.png';

// Placeholder de "Code/Terminal" elegante
const placeholderImg = "https://placehold.co/600x400/1a1a1a/22c55e/png?text=CODE_PREVIEW";

const projects = [
  {
    title: "Secured Portfolio V1",
    status: "Live",
    tech: ["Astro", "Tailwind", "TypeScript"],
    description: "Personal folio built with performance and security in mind. Features strict content security policies, zero-js runtime (mostly), and accessible architecture.",
    link: "https://github.com/yagogutierrezvazquez/PortfolioWeb",
    image: placeholderImg
  },
  {
    title: "Degree Final Project (TFG)",
    status: "Archived",
    tech: ["Angular", "Node.js", "Bootstrap"],
    description: "Full-stack web application developed for the Higher Technician degree. Implements complex data relationships, user authentication flows, and responsive UI design.",
    link: "https://github.com/yagogutierrezvazquez/SuccessStreet",
    image: placeholderImg
  }
];
---

<section id="projects" class="py-24 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 w-full border-t border-white/5">
  <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-mono font-bold text-green-500 mb-8 md:mb-12 uppercase tracking-tighter">
    > Featured_Projects
  </h2>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
    {projects.map((project) => (
      <article class="group relative bg-white/2 border border-white/10 rounded-sm overflow-hidden hover:border-green-500/30 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col h-full">
        
        <a href={project.link} target="_blank" class="block overflow-hidden h-48 relative">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-green-500/10 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors z-10"></div>
          {/* Usar <Image /> cuando tengas los archivos locales. Por ahora img normal para el placeholder remoto */}
          <img 
            src={project.image} 
            alt={project.title} 
            class="w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500 grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0"
          />
        </a>

        <div class="p-6 flex flex-col flex-1">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-4">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-green-400 transition-colors">
              {project.title}
            </h3>
            <span class="text-[10px] border border-green-500/30 text-green-500 px-2 py-1 rounded-sm font-mono uppercase">
              {project.status}
            </span>
          </div>

          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6 flex-1">
            {project.description}
          </p>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-2">
            {project.tech.map((t) => (
              <span class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-mono bg-white/5 px-2 py-2 rounded-sm">
                #{t}
              </span>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    ))}
  </div>
  
  <div class="mt-12 text-center">
    <p class="text-gray-500 font-mono text-sm">
      // More cybersecurity tools and scripts in development...
      <a href="https://github.com/yagogutierrezvazquez" target="_blank" class="text-green-500 hover:underline ml-2">Check GitHub</a>
    </p>
  </div>

</section>